# Everything in this repository is read by Linux containers, so the working tree keeps LF whatever
# core.autocrlf says on the machine that cloned it. It matters: docker-compose.yml carries an inline
# `sh -c` entrypoint for the mlflow database init, and a CRLF there puts a literal \r in the command.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
